    <briefdescription>
<para>Expander that simply annotates each scheduled instruction with a post-instr symbol that can be consumed by the ModuloScheduleTest pass. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The post-instr symbol is a way of annotating an instruction that can be roundtripped in MIR. The syntax is: MYINST %0, post-instr-symbol &lt;mcsymbol Stage-1_Cycle-5&gt; </para>
    </detaileddescription>
